SUMMARY:Milton Historic Cemetery Tour
LOCATION:Milton Historic Cemetery\, 6683 Berryhill Road\, Milton\, FL 32572
DESCRIPTION:Fri 10/16 - Sat 10/17 · timed tours every 15 minutes\, 6:00 PM
  to 9:00 PM\n\nMilton Historic Cemetery runs timed evening tours over two 
 nights in October\, with groups departing every 15 minutes rather than one
  mass tour start. The City of Milton sells no tickets on-site\, so a reser
 vation made in advance or by phone is the only way in. It is an outdoor\, 
 after-dark walk through headstones\, better suited to older kids and adult
 s than to strollers.\n\nPrice: from $25\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventur
 es.com/events/ev-miltoncemetery-tour.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-miltoncemetery-tour.html
CATEGORIES:Town and community
