 \, collecting treats along the way. It is a self-paced trick-or-treat rout
 e rather than a staged show\, so families can start and stop as they like 
 within the three-hour window.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: htt
 ps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-owa-candy-crawl-1031.html
