 ns the downtown Pensacola holiday season on the Friday after Thanksgiving\
 , with a costume contest\, wagons and groups marching through the Palafox 
 area. Families line up at Government Street and Palafox Place at 12:30 PM\
 , judging is at 1:25 PM and the parade steps off at 2:00 PM. Winterfest ev
 ening tours start the same night\, so the parade and a tour fit into one t
