SUMMARY:MoonPie Over Mobile New Year's Eve
LOCATION:Downtown Mobile: Mardi Gras Park and main stage\, Downtown Mobile\
 , AL 36602
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 12/31 · Kids Zone 11 AM · Main stage 6:30 PM to midn
 ight\n\nDowntown Mobile rings in the new year by lowering a giant electric
  MoonPie at midnight. The day starts at 11 AM with a kids zone in Mardi Gr
 as Park and an early noon drop for children. The evening program includes 
 a brass band\, a second-line parade and the cutting of the world's largest
  MoonPie before the midnight countdown. Admission is not stated on the sch
 edule page.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventu
 res.com/events/ev-moonpie-over-mobile-1231.html
